      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The researcher appears to be investigating microbial proliferation by examining a specimen under a microscope.",
          "grammar": "appear to be＋現在分詞 / by＋動名詞",
          "ja": "研究者は顕微鏡で検体を観察することによって、微生物の増殖を調べているようです。",
          "type": "gist",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The monitor displays a magnified field containing microorganisms with markedly different shapes and structures.",
          "grammar": "現在分詞 / with",
          "ja": "モニターには、形や構造が大きく異なる微生物を含む拡大画像が表示されています。",
          "type": "detail",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The abundance of visible organisms may indicate substantial proliferation within the biological sample.",
          "grammar": "may indicate",
          "ja": "多数の微生物が見えていることは、生物学的試料内でかなり増殖している可能性を示しています。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "By comparing microscopic images over time, the researcher could quantify changes in microbial population density.",
          "grammar": "By＋動名詞 / could",
          "ja": "時間の経過に伴う顕微鏡画像を比較することで、研究者は微生物の個体密度の変化を数量化できる可能性があります。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Differences in cellular morphology may help distinguish one microbial species from another.",
          "grammar": "may help / distinguish A from B",
          "ja": "細胞形態の違いは、ある微生物種を別の種と区別する助けになる可能性があります。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The use of gloves and carefully arranged laboratory equipment suggests that contamination must be minimized during the experiment.",
          "grammar": "suggest that / must be＋過去分詞",
          "ja": "手袋の使用や整然と配置された実験器具から、実験中の汚染を最小限に抑える必要があることがうかがえます。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "If a rapidly proliferating organism were pathogenic, monitoring its growth would be particularly important for scientific analysis.",
          "grammar": "仮定法過去 / 動名詞主語",
          "ja": "急速に増殖している生物が病原性を持つ場合、その増殖を監視することは科学的分析において特に重要になるでしょう。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Microscopy enables researchers to investigate biological structures that cannot normally be observed with the naked eye.",
          "grammar": "enable O to / 関係代名詞that",
          "ja": "顕微鏡を使うことで、研究者は通常肉眼では観察できない生物学的構造を調査できます。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Overall, the scene provides useful practice in describing microbial proliferation, microscopy, laboratory specimens, cellular morphology, scientific observation, and microbiological research.",
          "grammar": "動名詞列挙",
